      "evidence": [
        "Actual protected-session witness, owned heartbeat/close and publication/cleanup tests pass. Native live owner, creation mismatch, inaccessible anonymous-principal query and retained terminated process birth mismatch deny appropriately; matching terminated identity supports verified recovery. Actual reversed DPAPI layers against fixed trusted issuance are denied."
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion_index": 3,
      "checkIds": [
        "python-recovery",
        "existing-object-regression",
        "whole-native-core"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        "Explicit preview/confirm publishes only a verified recovery working copy after source/lock/heartbeat/database/WAL/object/fact checks. Actual whole-pair proof preserves original bytes and all39 canonical rows before normal fresh open, protected intent and lineage readback, and authentic object readback. Failure/cancel/key/path/race/audit and post-open cleanup cases pass."
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion_index": 4,
      "checkIds": [
        "python-recovery",
        "existing-object-regression",
        "native-recovery",
        "whole-native-core"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        "Actual separate Native/Core Jobs terminate and a fresh pair recovers original-derived protected state. Actual same-host foreign-instance close is denied with the owner usable and its lock/witness unchanged. Anonymous Windows principal, inner-user DPAPI and local path/tamper/unknown/owner denials pass. This is headless Native/Core proof, not shipping GUI qualification. Physical foreign-Windows-machine proof remains explicitly untested under the exact owner-approved timing supplement and is mandatory byW5 exit; it is outside this task's due-now completion. One pre-existing Windows vault-symlink case is skipped because this token cannot create it; other actual junction/hardlink denials are measured, and the skip is not a PASS."
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion_index": 5,
      "checkIds": [
        "python-recovery",
        "native-recovery",
        "whole-native-core",
        "approved-core45-architecture-proof",
        "task-adr"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        "Current evidence binds exact committed security/interface scope and truthful positive/negative results. Expanded independent commit-bound task disposition is requested separately; prior actual API completion-guard cleanup regression and the new birth-before-death regression pass. Original R03 P1 remains OPEN pending separately authorized original-fixture evidence and independent closure; a new-session fixture never closes it.",
        "The actual expanded independent commit-bound evidence advisory authenticates the exact final security/interface scope, positive/negative execution streams, prior cleanup and retained-process-birth finding closures, Core45 method and truthful residuals at this candidate. Formal controlled task disposition remains a separate required step."
      ]
    }
